ion": "GET READY", "dir": "down", "score": 10, "why": "Mixed structure.", "next": "Watch the 10-day average and cycle-day count.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "bear", "regime_label": "BEARISH", "regime_why": "weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low)", "regime_score": -4.0, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: BEARISH \u2014 weekly momentum negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low) (investor cycle week 15 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle day 14).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a low. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Still below the 10-day average"], "entry": {"tag": "WAIT", "tag_zh": "\u7b49\u5f85", "urgency": "later", "days_lo": 22, "days_hi": 28, "text": "A normal mid-cycle dip below the 10-day average \u2014 the real cycle low isn't due for ~22+ trading days. Wait for support to hold, or for the next low to set up.", "text_zh": "\u8fd9\u662f\u8dcc\u7834 10 \u65e5\u5747\u7ebf\u7684\u6b63\u5e38\u5468\u671f\u4e2d\u6bb5\u56de\u8c03\u2014\u2014\u771f\u6b63\u7684\u5468\u671f\u4f4e\u70b9\u8981\u5230\u7ea6 22+ \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5\u540e\u624d\u4f1a\u5230\u6765\u3002\u7b49\u5f85\u652f\u6491\u7ad9\u7a33\uff0c\u6216\u7b49\u4e0b\u4e00\u4e2a\u4f4e\u70b9\u6784\u7b51\u6210\u5f62\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 14 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "mid-cycle \u2014 trending", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 14 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u5468\u671f\u4e2d\u6bb5\u2014\u2014\u8d8b\u52bf\u8fd0\u884c\u4e2d", "weekly_line": "Weekly (investor) cycle: week 15 of a typical 16\u201326 weeks", "weekly_phase": "late \u2014 the bigger cycle is getting old